        <button id="refreshStatusBtn" class="refresh-btn" title="换一条状态">How are you？</button>
        <p>now I'm <a href="https://www.imood.com/users/isntbunny"></a><img src="https://moods.imood.com/display/uname-isntbunny/fg-000000/bg-ffffff/imood.gif" alt="The current mood of isntbunny at www.imood.com" border="0" /></a></p>
        <div id="statuscafe-username">thinking</div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>



